The sketch reveal in drawn-reveal.js (0.67) is a JavaScript port of the planning code of whiteboard-animation-vi
(https://github.com/letuandat131/whiteboard-animation-vi, pinned c689bf7fd75fb4cb84f6ae2880a4dac6f40b92d0):
handdraw/v181d_plan.py, grid.py, grid_stream.py, v181d_cluster.py, v181d_palette.py, v181d_subject_fill.py,
v181e_background_fill.py and pixels.py. Its original code is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
Its grid routing (handdraw/grid_stream.py) derives from SRT Whiteboard, whose MIT licence is kept in LICENSE beside this
notice. No source file of the repository is included, and none of its hand images, model weights or demo art is used:
the program draws its own hand, and the repository's ISNet subject model (SkyTNT Anime Segmentation) is replaced by a
border rule in our port.
